      "lines": [
        11,
        16
      ],
      "raw": "* A homepage showcasing diverse and appealing rewards (e.g., travel, cashback, exclusive deals).\n* AI-driven suggestions based on customer behavior and offer metadata, surfacing the newest, most popular, or recommended offers.\n* Search and category filters to browse or look up offers by brand or reward type.\n* A \"My Offers\" section to track favorite, activated, and purchased rewards.\n* A profile section showing account details and transaction history.\n* A help section with FAQs and support options to assist customers independently.",
